{"id":10112,"chapter_id":10,"scene_id":1013,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"一只巨大的手猛的擒住你，灼痕燃烧，遍布整个空间。","style":3,"background":912,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"蔻蔻","content":"唔……这是……是什么……枷锁的感觉，不太对？","voice":["vo_cgplot_10112002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_1011","style":1,"background":912,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"骸","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>枷锁……是枷锁……但……不是她……</color></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_10112003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_1011","style":1,"background":912,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"骸","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>你也和她一样……要来吞噬我吗……</color></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_10112004"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_1011","style":1,"background":912,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"骸","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><size=44><i>不……我不要…………你们……不配……</color></size></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_10112005"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_1011","style":1,"background":912,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"骸","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><size=44><i>该死的是你们！！</color></size></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_10112006"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_1011","style":1,"background":912,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"content":"枷锁与之纠缠，相互搏斗，而某种更强烈的情感灼烧着你的身体和精神。","style":3,"background":912,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"content":"是友人逝去的悲痛？还是对重重阴谋的愤怒？是你失去记忆中的偏执本性？还是在你本能深处压抑不住的疯狂与激动？","style":3,"background":912,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"content":"你已经失去分辨这种感情的理智，于连的身影变得模糊，他似乎在大叫着什么，你无从分辨。","style":3,"background":912,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"content":"慢慢地，你视野里出现了一个怪异的形状，像一轮红月，一只眼眸，一个搏动的胚胎。它在呼唤你，在吸食你——","style":3,"background":923,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"？？","content":"局长——！？？！","voice":["vo_cgplot_10112011"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_1011","style":1,"background":923,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"【转场】","content":"【转场】","style":18,"background":913,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"content":"一声尖锐的呼唤打破了眼前的幻象，你的意识恢复清明，视野却模糊而猩红。有一个熟悉的身影闯入办公室。","style":3,"background":913,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"选项","options":["……赫卡蒂？"],"jump":[16],"style":6,"background":913,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"content":"你发不出声音。粘稠的液体堵住了咽喉，又从鼻腔、眼角溢出，是带着铁锈般的腥味，你无法分辨到底是什么，只隐约看到赫卡蒂的表情如见末日。","style":3,"background":913,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"梦魇！","voice":["vo_cgplot_10112015"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_1011","style":1,"background":913,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"content":"梦魇冲了过去，被受骸者瞬间撕碎。禁闭者被重击一般几乎跪地，但她立刻挣扎起身，向你奔来。你瞬间清醒。","style":3,"background":913,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"speaker":"选项","options":["别过来！"],"jump":[20],"style":6,"background":913,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"content":"禁止力生效，枷锁刺出，将她困在原地。可太晚了，受骸者发现新的猎物，带着狂喜的嘶鸣向赫卡蒂冲去。","style":3,"background":913,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"content":"——那一刻，愤怒和恐惧燃尽你仅存的理智，红色的枷锁咆哮着向前穿透它的身体。","style":3,"background":913,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"speaker":"骸","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><size=44><i>啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！！你竟敢，你竟然也——！</color></size></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_10112020"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_1011","style":1,"background":913,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"speaker":"骸","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><size=44><i>连你也想……就凭你……就凭你？！！</color></size></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_10112021"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_1011","style":1,"background":913,"log_type":1},{"step":24,"speaker":"选项","options":["枷锁，吞噬它！"],"jump":[25],"style":6,"background":913,"log_type":1},{"step":25,"content":"某种强大的能量在你体内爆发，但并不是你熟悉的枷锁。","style":3,"background":913,"log_type":1},{"step":27,"content":"蓝光向内刺穿你的意识，像被千根冰锥刺透，彻骨寒冷。原本束缚着敌人的赤红光芒渐渐瓦解，被束缚的怪物开始挣扎。","style":3,"background":913,"log_type":1},{"step":28,"content":"真是……意想不到的意外。","style":3,"background":913,"log_type":1},{"step":29,"speaker":"骸","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><size=44><i>我不是为成就你们的，你不行……她也不行！！</color></size></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_10112026"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_1011","style":1,"background":913,"log_type":1},{"step":30,"speaker":"骸","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><size=44><i>我，不会，死在这里！！</color></size></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_10112027"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_1011","style":1,"background":913,"log_type":1},{"step":31,"content":"无数触须咆哮着向你袭来，在触及撕扯你之前，一个金属巨物袭来，将它击飞了几步。于连竭力攀着控制台，这是极限了，他再无法移动，只能向你大喊。","style":3,"background":912,"log_type":1},{"step":32,"speaker":"于连","content":"过来，地面要塌了！","voice":["vo_cgplot_10112029"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_1011","style":1,"background":912,"log_type":1},{"step":33,"speaker":"于连","content":"禁闭者，去救他！快——","female_content":"禁闭者，去救她！快——","voice":["vo_cgplot_10112030","vo_cgplot_10112030f"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_1011","style":1,"background":912,"log_type":1},{"step":34,"speaker":"骸","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><size=44><i>啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！！</color></size></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_10112031"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_1011","style":1,"background":912,"log_type":1},{"step":35,"content":"它发出一声咆哮，随即有什么巨大的力量甩到你身上，你离开了地面，撞出本已破碎的窗户，随即快速坠落。","style":3,"background":912,"log_type":1},{"step":36,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"不要！！梦魇，梦魇？！！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_10112033"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_1011","style":1,"background":912,"log_type":1},{"step":37,"content":"少女的使魔早已被撕碎，她失去了习以为常的力量，看你向下坠落，竟像呆住了一般。","style":3,"background":912,"log_type":1},{"step":38,"content":"流民寨复杂的机械堡垒快速从四周升起，你的身体失去控制，不断被撞击。有什么试图兜住你，保护你，软的，硬的，却被一一撞破、扯断，而你继续下坠。","style":3,"background":913,"log_type":1},{"step":39,"content":"你听到人群的惊呼，嘴里充斥着血腥味，冷风和灼痛对冲着你的感官。时间仿佛停滞，疼痛不断让你昏迷又清醒。直到——","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":40,"content":"砰！！","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1},{"step":41,"content":"【转场】","style":18,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":42,"content":"彻底坠入黑暗。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1}]}